<title>USA: Xerox Corp earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Xerox Corp earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary prof	 $1.25		loss $3.34</p>
<p> Shr diluted prof	  1.17		loss  3.43</p>
<p> Oper shr dil pro	  1.17	     profit 1.30</p>
<p> Net profit		426,000	    loss 1,093,000</p>
<p> Revs		    5,075,000		   4,755,000</p>
<p>			     12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary prof	  $3.49	    loss    $1.56</p>
<p> Shr diluted prof	   3.31	    loss    1.75</p>
<p> Oper shr dil pro	   3.31	    profit  3.21</p>
<p> Net	profit     1,206,000	    loss   472,000</p>
<p> Revs		   17,378,000		  16,588,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Total common shares used to calculate fully diluted earnings per share were 363.7 million, compared with 363.1 million the year before.  Total common shares used to calculate primary earnings per share were 332.7 million, compared with 331.7 million a year ago.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610)</p>
